     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">各位前輩好:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">有一份資料</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">id \r\nA1  B1  B2 \r\nA2  C1  C2  C3</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1  \r\n1    2   0  \r\n4   5   6   7</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2  \r\n5    6   8  \r\n8   1   3   2</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">                                                                               \r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">請問如果我希望</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">A1+A2</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">形成一個新的變數，變成新的一欄叫作</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">A</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">B1+B2</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">形成一個新的變數，變成新的一欄叫作</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">C1+C2+C3</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">形成一個新的變數，變成新的一欄叫作</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">C</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">想要得到</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">id  \r\nA  B  C</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">1  \r\n5   2  18</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2  \r\n13  14  6</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">                                                                               \r\n</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">我試著用</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">aggregate</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">colSums</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">去做但沒有成功，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">請問用有人可以出手指導嗎</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">謝謝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">!</span></p></div>"
