     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Hsin-Ying,<div><br></div><div>本題計算直接相加, 應該不用使用 aggregate, colSums.</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CL1LJC3OBHg/WVe4pZS7XjI/AAAAAAAALrE/g-nxZue6USccwMMAFImot61x2Vtg1LCHgCLcBGAs/s1600/newColumn.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CL1LJC3OBHg/WVe4pZS7XjI/AAAAAAAALrE/g-nxZue6USccwMMAFImot61x2Vtg1LCHgCLcBGAs/s1600/newColumn.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237626895000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Bi3sItJ0umCuI2uYvlvkg\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-CL1LJC3OBHg/WVe4pZS7XjI/AAAAAAAALrE/g-nxZue6USccwMMAFImot61x2Vtg1LCHgCLcBGAs/s400/newColumn.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"337\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div># title: new columns</div><div># date: 2017.7.1</div><div>mydata &lt;- read.table(text=&quot;</div></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div>                     id  A1  B1  B2  A2  C1  C2  C3</div><div>                     1   1    2   0   4   5   6   7</div></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div>                     2   5    6   8   8   1   3   2&quot;,</div><div>                     header=TRUE)</div><div>mydata</div><div>mydata$A &lt;- mydata$A1 + mydata$A2</div><div>mydata$B &lt;- mydata$B1 + mydata$B2</div><div>mydata$C &lt;- mydata$C1 + mydata$C2 + mydata$C3</div><div>mydata</div><div>mynewdata &lt;- mydata[c(1, 9:11)]</div><div>mynewdata</div><div># ends</div></div></code></div></div><div><br>Hsin Ying Huang於 2017年6月28日星期三 UTC+8下午1時01分32秒寫道：</div></div>"
